    <h2>Important Changes for 1999</h2>
    <p>Standard deduction. For most people, the standard deduction has increased. See <span data-field="link_to_standard_deduction">{{ link_to_standard_deduction }}</span>, later.</p>

    <h2>Earned income credit.</h2>
    <p>You may be eligible for the credit if you earn less than:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><span data-field="income_threshold_1">{{ income_threshold_1 }}</span> and have one qualifying child living with you,</li>
      <li><span data-field="income_threshold_2">{{ income_threshold_2 }}</span> and have more than one qualifying child living with you, or</li>
      <li><span data-field="income_threshold_3">{{ income_threshold_3 }}</span>, do not have a qualifying child, and are at least 25 years old and under 65.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>For more information, see <span data-field="link_to_earned_income_credit">{{ link_to_earned_income_credit }}</span>, later.</p>

